{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 43,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Demon-Possessed Man Healed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they came to the other side of the sea, to the country of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Gerasenes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Gadarenes. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when He had come out of the boat, immediately there met Him out of the tombs a man with an unclean spirit, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who had "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " dwelling among the tombs; and no one could bind "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds anymore"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "him, not even with chains, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "because he had often been bound with shackles and chains. And the chains had been pulled apart by him, and the shackles broken in pieces; neither could anyone tame him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And always, night and day, he was in the mountains and in the tombs, crying out and cutting himself with stones."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When he saw Jesus from afar, he ran and worshiped Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he cried out with a loud voice and said, “What have I to do with You, Jesus, Son of the Most High God? I implore"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "adjure"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " You by God that You do not torment me.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Come out of the man, unclean spirit!”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He asked him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“What is your name?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he answered, saying, “My name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Legion; for we are many.” "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also he begged Him earnestly that He would not send them out of the country."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now a large herd of swine was feeding there near the mountains. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So all the demons begged Him, saying, “Send us to the swine, that we may enter them.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU He gave"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "at once Jesus gave them permission. Then the unclean spirits went out and entered the swine (there were about two thousand); and the herd ran violently down the steep place into the sea, and drowned in the sea."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So those who fed the swine fled, and they told "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the city and in the country. And they went out to see what it was that had happened. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they came to Jesus, and saw the one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who had been"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " demon-possessed and had the legion, sitting and clothed and in his right mind. And they were afraid. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And those who saw it told them how it happened to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who had been"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " demon-possessed, and about the swine. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they began to plead with Him to depart from their region."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when He got into the boat, he who had been demon-possessed begged Him that he might be with Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "However, Jesus did not permit him, but said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Go home to your friends, and tell them what great things the Lord has done for you, and how He has had compassion on you.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he departed and began to proclaim in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Ten Cities"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Decapolis all that Jesus had done for him; and all marveled."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Girl Restored to Life and a Woman Healed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when Jesus had crossed over again by boat to the other side, a great multitude gathered to Him; and He was by the sea. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And behold, one of the rulers of the synagogue came, Jairus by name. And when he saw Him, he fell at His feet "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and begged Him earnestly, saying, “My little daughter lies at the point of death. Come and lay Your hands on her, that she may be healed, and she will live.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Jesus"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " went with him, and a great multitude followed Him and thronged Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now a certain woman had a flow of blood for twelve years, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and had suffered many things from many physicians. She had spent all that she had and was no better, but rather grew worse. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When she heard about Jesus, she came behind "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the crowd and touched His garment. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For she said, “If only I may touch His clothes, I shall be made well.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Immediately the fountain of her blood was dried up, and she felt in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "her"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " body that she was healed of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "suffering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "affliction. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus, immediately knowing in Himself that power had gone out of Him, turned around in the crowd and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Who touched My clothes?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But His disciples said to Him, “You see the multitude thronging You, and You say, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘Who touched Me?’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He looked around to see her who had done this thing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the woman, fearing and trembling, knowing what had happened to her, came and fell down before Him and told Him the whole truth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to her, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Daughter,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "your faith has made you well."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Go in peace, and be healed of your affliction.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While He was still speaking, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came from the ruler of the synagogue’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who said, “Your daughter is dead. Why trouble the Teacher any further?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As soon as Jesus heard the word that was spoken, He said to the ruler of the synagogue, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Do not be afraid; only"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "believe.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He permitted no one to follow Him except Peter, James, and John the brother of James. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He came to the house of the ruler of the synagogue, and saw "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "an uproar"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a tumult and those who wept and wailed loudly. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He came in, He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Why make this commotion and weep? The child is not dead, but"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "sleeping.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they ridiculed Him. But when He had put them all outside, He took the father and the mother of the child, and those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with Him, and entered where the child was lying. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He took the child by the hand, and said to her, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Talitha, cumi,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " which is translated, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Little girl, I say to you, arise.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Immediately the girl arose and walked, for she was twelve years "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of age."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And they were overcome with great amazement. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But He commanded them strictly that no one should know it, and said that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "something"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " should be given her to eat."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}